{"version":"6.9","hitCount":1,"request":{"queryString":"EXT_ID:15859369","resultType":"core","cursorMark":"*","pageSize":25,"sort":"","synonym":false},"resultList":{"result":[{"id":"15859369","source":"MED","pmid":"15859369","doi":"10.1080/00926230590477934","title":"Transvestic fetishism in the general population: prevalence and correlates.","authorString":"Långström N, Zucker KJ.","authorList":{"author":[{"fullName":"Långström N","lastName":"Långström","firstName":"Niklas","initials":"N","authorId":{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0002-2686-6799"},"authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Centre for Violence Prevention, Karolinska Institutet, Stockholm, Sweden. niklas.langstrom@cns.ki.se"}]}},{"fullName":"Zucker KJ","lastName":"Zucker","firstName":"Kenneth J","initials":"KJ"}]},"authorIdList":{"authorId":[{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0002-2686-6799"}]},"journalInfo":{"issue":"2","volume":"31","journalIssueId":1229329,"dateOfPublication":"2005 Mar-Apr","monthOfPublication":0,"yearOfPublication":2005,"journal":{"medlineAbbreviation":"J Sex Marital Ther","title":"Journal of sex & marital therapy","essn":"1521-0715","issn":"0092-623X","isoabbreviation":"J Sex Marital Ther","nlmid":"7502387"},"printPublicationDate":"2005-03-01"},"pubYear":"2005","pageInfo":"87-95","abstractText":"We used a random sample of 2,450 18-60 year-olds in the general population of Sweden to study the prevalence as well as the social, sexual, and health correlates of transvestic fetishism (sexual arousal from cross-dressing). Almost three percent (2.8%) of men and 0.4% of women reported at least one episode of transvestic fetishism. Separation from parents, same-sex sexual experiences, being easily sexually aroused, pornography use, and higher masturbation frequency were significantly associated with transvestic fetishism. A positive attitude to this sexual practice and paraphilia indicators--sexual arousal from using pain, exposing genitals to a stranger, and spying on others having sex--were particularly strong correlates to the dependent variable.","affiliation":"Centre for Violence Prevention, Karolinska Institutet, Stockholm, Sweden. niklas.langstrom@cns.ki.se","publicationStatus":"ppublish","language":"eng","pubModel":"Print","pubTypeList":{"pubType":["Journal Article"]},"meshHeadingList":{"meshHeading":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Humans"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Prevalence"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Statistics, Nonparametric"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Cross-Sectional Studies"},{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","descriptorName":"Health Behavior"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Sexual Behavior","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","abbreviation":"SN","qualifierName":"statistics & numerical data"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Interpersonal Relations"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Transvestism","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","abbreviation":"EP","qualifierName":"epidemiology"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","abbreviation":"PX","qualifierName":"psychology"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Sex Factors"},{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","descriptorName":"Public Opinion"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Adult"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Aged"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Middle Aged"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Sweden","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","abbreviation":"EP","qualifierName":"epidemiology"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Female"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Male"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Surveys and Questionnaires"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Fetishism, Psychiatric","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","abbreviation":"EP","qualifierName":"epidemiology"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","abbreviation":"PX","qualifierName":"psychology"}]}}]},"subsetList":{"subset":[{"code":"IM","name":"Index Medicus"}]},"fullTextUrlList":{"fullTextUrl":[{"availability":"Subscription required","availabilityCode":"S","documentStyle":"doi","site":"DOI","url":"https://doi.org/10.1080/00926230590477934"}]},"isOpenAccess":"N","inEPMC":"N","inPMC":"N","citedByCount":50,"hasReferences":"Y","hasTextMinedTerms":"Y","hasDbCrossReferences":"N","hasPDF":"N","hasBook":"N","hasSuppl":"N","hasLabsLinks":"N","hasData":"N","authMan":"N","epmcAuthMan":"N","nihAuthMan":"N","hasTMAccessionNumbers":"N","dateOfCompletion":"2005-07-15","dateOfCreation":"2005-04-30","dateOfRevision":"2019-12-10","firstPublicationDate":"2005-03-01","firstIndexDate":"2008-01-29","hasEvaluations":"N"}]}}